595 0 obj
<<
/Title (The volume of news data generated daily is extremely large, making it difficult to analyze manually using traditional methods. With the rapid growth of digital media, there is a need for efficient tools that can handle and process such large datasets. Big Data technologies like Apache Spark and Kafka enable fast and scalable data processing. This project focuses on analyzing news trends by processing large-scale data and extracting meaningful insights such as patterns over time, source activity, and category distribution.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 307 0 R
>>
endobj
