598 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project successfully demonstrates the use of big data technologies for processing and analyzing large-scale news datasets. Apache Spark was used to efficiently clean and preprocess the data, while Kafka was integrated to simulate a streaming data pipeline. Through this approach, meaningful insights were extracted by performing year-wise and month-wise trend analysis, as well as examining the contribution of different news sources and categories. The use of visualizations helped in clearly understanding patterns and variations in the data. Overall, the project highlights the importance of scalable tools in handling large datasets and shows how they can be effectively used to generate valuable insights from real-world data.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 308 0 R
>>
endobj
