/Title (Traditional data processing systems are not capable of efficiently handling the large-scale volume of news data generated every day. As the size and complexity of data increase, there is a strong need for scalable solutions that provide efficient processing and storage. Additionally, extracting meaningful insights such as trends and patterns from news articles becomes challenging without proper tools. This project aims to address these challenges by analyzing news data to identify trends over time and understand the publishing behavior of different news sources.)
